WEBVTT

00:05.501 --> 00:06.591
Doran!

00:07.551 --> 00:12.511
I was only able to save you because 
of a nameless adventurer.

00:12.911 --> 00:16.831
Let him... protect you...

00:17.921 --> 00:21.521
The one who recognizes that ring...

00:26.261 --> 00:27.901
Regarding last night's destruction of

00:27.901 --> 00:29.981
Yatan Temple in the
northern Eternal Kingdom...

00:30.431 --> 00:32.721
The disaster happened when Grid 
and Yura battled each other

00:32.721 --> 00:34.451
in an attempt to finish a quest.

00:34.711 --> 00:36.701
The battle ended with Yura's victory.

00:36.701 --> 00:42.201
Oh? So Yura was doing the Yatan cult 
quest, "Servant of the God Yatan"?

00:42.201 --> 00:47.281
It's interesting that Grid 
was involved, as well.

00:42.201 --> 00:49.101
Ghost Appears at Yatan Temple

00:42.201 --> 00:49.101
Yatan Temple Collapses

00:47.731 --> 00:48.901
Where is she now?

00:48.901 --> 00:52.081
Leveling up in the wastelands 
in northern Eternal.

00:52.441 --> 00:55.241
She's stayed logged in even 
after clearing the quest,

00:55.241 --> 00:58.051
so she'll be reaching her 
real-world physical limits soon.

00:58.671 --> 01:01.251
It seems the events of 
the day got to her, then.

01:01.931 --> 01:02.931
I can see why.

01:03.391 --> 01:08.941
Grid... I can't wait to see what 
else you have in store for us...

01:10.641 --> 01:12.511
no, for <i>Satisfy</i>.

01:35.231 --> 01:36.761
<b>Overgeared</b>

01:36.761 --> 01:39.991
<b>Overgeared</b>

02:48.961 --> 02:49.961
<i>System guidance.</i>

02:49.081 --> 02:49.961
<b>You've Arrived at Bairan Village</b>

02:50.291 --> 02:52.961
Huh? Bairan Village?

02:50.591 --> 02:55.471
<i>You are now an enemy of the Yatan cult 
and can no longer revive at their temple.</i>

02:55.471 --> 02:57.641
So that's what happened, huh?

02:57.641 --> 03:00.721
I've been to this village before...

03:01.891 --> 03:06.351
I'm looking for a mage above level 
130 who can come to the Mubaid Ruins!

03:06.351 --> 03:10.151
Come with me to get the 
ultimate ore, Blue Orichalcum!

03:10.151 --> 03:12.441
Looking for people over level 100!

03:12.441 --> 03:14.531
Those are some high levels!

03:14.531 --> 03:18.031
Well, the monsters around here 
all have levels above 100.

03:18.451 --> 03:19.991
Level 100...

03:20.951 --> 03:22.451
I can't even leave the village!

03:24.501 --> 03:28.371
Um, I'd like to go to the 
lowest-level village.

03:28.371 --> 03:31.171
If you're a beginner, you want 
to go to Winston Village.

03:31.171 --> 03:33.051
It'll cost you 10 gold.

03:33.051 --> 03:34.381
Um...

03:34.761 --> 03:36.171
<b>Currency</b>

03:34.761 --> 03:36.171
<b>Gold</b>

03:34.761 --> 03:36.171
<b>Silver</b>

03:37.631 --> 03:38.631
Get lost.

03:39.181 --> 03:41.221
You see, my mom's sick.

03:41.221 --> 03:42.101
Get lost.

03:44.311 --> 03:46.601
Merciless capitalism!

03:46.601 --> 03:51.361
<i>No, I'm a legendary class! 
A legendary blacksmith!</i>

03:51.731 --> 03:54.531
<i>My legend begins here!</i>

03:55.611 --> 03:56.321
<i>Probably...</i>

03:57.281 --> 04:04.411
<b>Class Skills</b>

03:57.281 --> 03:58.821
Wow!

03:58.821 --> 04:05.121
The skills I've mastered give me 
a +10% bonus to all class stats!

04:04.991 --> 04:08.291
<b><u>Legendary Blacksmith Master Creation (Uses: 3/3)</u>

* Every level of Legendary Blacksmith Master Creation
will allow you to create 3 new item recipes.
* Using items created by this skill will automatically
imprint them with the name of their creator.</b>

04:04.991 --> 04:08.291
<b>m 0 0 l 295 0 295 30 0 30</b>

04:05.121 --> 04:08.291
And I can also make any item I want!

04:08.291 --> 04:09.831
<i>System guidance.</i>

04:09.831 --> 04:12.921
<i>You are about to use Legendary 
Blacksmith Master Creation.</i>

04:12.921 --> 04:14.921
<i>What kind of item will you make?</i>

04:14.921 --> 04:17.051
A greatsword, of course.

04:17.421 --> 04:19.721
<i>What materials will you use?</i>

04:19.721 --> 04:22.091
It'd be better to use 
something stronger, right?

04:22.091 --> 04:25.511
<b>Legendary Blacksmith Master Creation</b>

04:22.091 --> 04:25.511
<b>Item to Create</b>

04:22.091 --> 04:25.511
<b>Greatsword</b>

04:22.091 --> 04:25.511
<b>Materials</b>

04:22.551 --> 04:24.431
I know! Blue Orichalcum!

04:23.301 --> 04:23.431
<b>Bl</b>

04:23.431 --> 04:23.551
<b>Blue</b>

04:23.551 --> 04:23.681
<b>Blue O</b>

04:23.681 --> 04:23.801
<b>Blue Ori</b>

04:23.801 --> 04:23.931
<b>Blue Oricha</b>

04:23.931 --> 04:24.051
<b>Blue Orichal</b>

04:24.051 --> 04:24.181
<b>Blue Orichalcu</b>

04:24.181 --> 04:24.601
<b>Blue Orichalcum</b>

04:25.261 --> 04:28.391
<i>Please define the crafting plan 
and weapon characteristics.</i>

04:28.391 --> 04:30.141
Okay, got it!

04:30.141 --> 04:34.481
Big! Powerful! Hits like a shark and 
has an attack stat of over 10 million!

04:34.731 --> 04:36.981
Each time it attacks, a meteor falls!

04:36.981 --> 04:40.321
It also ignores enemy defense 
and can defeat them in one hit!

04:40.321 --> 04:41.781
Done!

04:40.321 --> 04:41.781
<b>Attack</b>

04:40.321 --> 04:41.781
<b>Cool!</b>

04:40.321 --> 04:41.781
<b>Like a shark!!</b>

04:40.321 --> 04:41.781
<b>lots of meteors fall!!</b>

04:40.321 --> 04:41.781
<b>insta-kill!!!</b>

04:42.411 --> 04:44.201
<i>So cool!</i>

04:44.741 --> 04:46.831
It really looks like a shark!

04:46.831 --> 04:48.621
Or maybe a sardine.

04:48.621 --> 04:51.711
A genius? Am I a genius?!

04:51.711 --> 04:53.461
<i>Beginning auto-optimization.</i>

04:53.751 --> 04:55.171
<i>Weapon skills and options</i>

04:55.171 --> 04:59.011
<i>will be automatically optimized to 
match the design and crafting material.</i>

04:59.011 --> 05:02.131
I guess I asked for too much?

05:05.351 --> 05:07.181
<i>Wh-What?</i>

05:07.561 --> 05:10.641
<i>I can understand how this item is made!</i>

05:10.891 --> 05:15.481
<b></b>Class applied to this item:





Unique ~ Legendary

05:11.191 --> 05:13.651
<i>I'm like a real blacksmith!</i>

05:15.271 --> 05:17.151
<b>Auto-optimization complete</b>

05:24.571 --> 05:28.331
Its durability is 1,090, 
and its attack is 1,820!

05:28.331 --> 05:30.251
And its options are awesome, too!

05:30.541 --> 05:33.251
I don't have any class 
restrictions on equipment.

05:33.251 --> 05:36.211
Now all I need is Blue Orichalcum...

05:36.421 --> 05:37.501
I don't have any!

05:39.131 --> 05:41.841
I won't let you join my party.

05:41.841 --> 05:45.511
With that equipment, 
you're around level 60, huh?

05:45.511 --> 05:49.061
Uh, I'm actually level 100!

05:49.061 --> 05:52.561
I'm confident in my skills, so I don't 
care much about my equipment...

05:52.561 --> 05:53.851
What?

05:53.851 --> 05:56.151
Are you saying the rest of us 
are reliant on our items?

05:56.151 --> 05:59.271
That we're wimps?
Helpless without our items?

05:59.481 --> 06:02.241
And you're clearly <i>not</i> level 100!

06:02.241 --> 06:05.201
And you're a jerk on top 
of that? You're worthless!

06:02.241 --> 06:03.901
<i>I never said any of that!</i>

06:03.901 --> 06:06.241
<i>Also, you're kind of a jerk, too!</i>

06:06.241 --> 06:08.951
I think it's fine, Toban.

06:08.951 --> 06:09.701
Regas...

06:10.161 --> 06:14.961
<i>That's Regas the Holy Fist, 
the top martial artist!</i>

06:14.961 --> 06:19.131
We in the Tzedakah Guild will be 
handling the boss monster anyway.

06:19.461 --> 06:21.341
Let's have him do other work.

06:21.341 --> 06:23.631
<i>That's right, Regas! You tell him!</i>

06:23.631 --> 06:27.141
But I don't know if I can 
persuade the others...

06:27.141 --> 06:31.641
Let's test him and see 
his abilities, then.

06:32.431 --> 06:34.101
<i>Shit!</i>

06:35.061 --> 06:37.151
Now, come at me!

06:37.151 --> 06:39.981
No, I think I'd rather 
spend the day leveling!

06:43.241 --> 06:44.951
That's a shame...

06:44.951 --> 06:46.161
<i>Screw that!</i>

06:46.161 --> 06:49.071
<i>I can't fight somebody that 
famous and high-ranking!</i>

06:49.071 --> 06:54.001
<b>Legendary Blacksmith Master Creation</b>

06:49.071 --> 06:54.001
<b></b>Uses

06:49.071 --> 06:54.001
<b>m 0 0 l 50 0 50 5 0 5</b>

06:49.071 --> 06:54.001
<b></b>Enter the name of the item you're creating

06:50.081 --> 06:51.121
Shut up!

06:51.121 --> 06:53.831
It doesn't matter how strong 
the item is if I can't make it!

06:53.581 --> 06:55.541
<b>Failure</b>

06:54.001 --> 06:55.541
<b>Item Name</b>

06:55.751 --> 06:59.541
Damn it. I'll have to start grinding.

07:00.291 --> 07:03.711
You want to know how to make items 
that sell for a lot of money?

07:03.711 --> 07:05.551
Yes! Please tell me.

07:08.141 --> 07:09.301
Get lost.

07:09.891 --> 07:12.561
You're trying to make money the easy way.

07:12.561 --> 07:14.601
Blacksmithing isn't that simple, you know.

07:14.601 --> 07:19.651
Aw, come on. I'm not asking for much.

07:21.231 --> 07:24.231
Everyone who underestimates 
the work is the same.

07:24.231 --> 07:29.201
They've never done anything themselves.

07:29.201 --> 07:30.991
Now get lost.

07:36.211 --> 07:38.831
I guess I'm stuck in the village.

07:41.081 --> 07:43.051
What, you're still here?

07:44.251 --> 07:46.261
I don't have any money.

07:49.431 --> 07:51.801
Well, I can't have you 
dying in front of my forge.

07:52.051 --> 07:54.431
Go chop some firewood for me.

07:53.931 --> 07:56.351
<b></b>Quest

07:53.931 --> 07:56.351
<b>Chop Firewood</b>

07:53.931 --> 07:56.351
<b></b>The Blacksmith "Smith" has given you the task of
cutting firewood to test your abilities.

07:53.931 --> 07:56.351
<b>m 0 0 l 310 0 310 8 0 8</b>

07:53.931 --> 07:56.351
<b>m 0 0 l 185 0 185 8 0 8</b>

07:53.931 --> 07:56.351
<b></b>Clear Condition: Chop 500 pieces of firewood

07:53.931 --> 07:56.351
<b>m 0 0 l 195 0 195 8 0 8</b>

07:53.931 --> 07:56.351
<b></b>Clear Reward: +10 reputation from Smith

07:53.931 --> 07:56.351
<b>m 0 0 l 255 0 255 8 0 8</b>

07:53.931 --> 07:56.351
<b></b>+10 experience

07:53.931 --> 07:56.351
<b>m 0 0 l 80 0 80 8 0 8</b>

07:53.931 --> 07:56.351
<b></b>+20 bronze

07:53.931 --> 07:56.351
<b>m 0 0 l 130 0 130 8 0 8</b>

07:53.931 --> 07:56.351
<b></b>Failure: -10 reputation from Smith

07:53.931 --> 07:56.351
<b>m 0 0 l 210 0 210 8 0 8</b>

08:01.981 --> 08:04.361
It's been so long since 
I've had a normal quest!

08:04.361 --> 08:07.321
First, I have to test the 
durability of this axe!

08:07.611 --> 08:08.571
Appraise!

08:09.911 --> 08:14.621
<b>Old Axe</b>

08:09.911 --> 08:14.621
<b></b>Class: Normal

08:09.911 --> 08:14.621
<b></b>Durability

08:09.911 --> 08:14.621
<b>m 0 0 l 50 0 50 8 0 8</b>

08:09.911 --> 08:14.621
<b></b>Attack

08:09.911 --> 08:14.621
<b>m 0 0 l 50 0 50 8 0 8</b>

08:10.161 --> 08:14.621
<b></b>Your understanding of the <b>Old Axe
</b>has reached 100%

08:10.241 --> 08:12.071
My understanding is at 100%?

08:12.451 --> 08:14.541
Is that another class bonus?

08:16.121 --> 08:17.661
I'm supposed to aim there?

08:18.461 --> 08:21.041
Is that what happens when 
your understanding increases?

08:26.211 --> 08:29.341
At this rate, I'll finish in no time!

08:42.401 --> 08:47.031
Man, my endurance at level -3 is shit.

08:47.031 --> 08:50.571
And why am I doing 
physical labor in a game?

08:50.571 --> 08:55.371
My whole body hurts, and I'm exhausted.

09:00.161 --> 09:03.131
I'm about to pass out, but...

09:11.631 --> 09:14.221
<i>What's this feeling?</i>

09:14.801 --> 09:19.271
<i>Just moving my body over and over 
again doesn't seem that bad, actually.</i>

09:20.431 --> 09:23.601
<i>So maybe I should take 
my work seriously...</i>

09:24.521 --> 09:26.321
<i>for once in my life!</i>

09:29.111 --> 09:30.821
<b>Fortitude</b>

09:29.111 --> 09:30.821
<b></b>You don't get tired as easily.

09:29.111 --> 09:30.821
<b></b>Your max carry weight has increased.

09:29.611 --> 09:30.821
<i>System guidance.</i>

