09:31.241 --> 09:33.531
<i>A new stat has been unlocked.</i>

09:34.071 --> 09:37.371
<i>The higher your fortitude, the longer 
it will take for you to get tired.</i>

09:37.371 --> 09:39.491
<i>You will be able to carry 
more weight, as well.</i>

09:37.621 --> 09:39.911
A legendary limited ability, huh?

09:39.911 --> 09:42.541
I feel like I'm overflowing with power.

09:42.791 --> 09:46.041
Okay, I'm gonna finish 
this no matter what!

09:54.451 --> 09:56.721
A... A thousand pieces?

09:58.051 --> 10:00.641
This was nothing!

10:00.641 --> 10:04.141
I'm a blacksmith, even if I don't look it!

10:05.601 --> 10:06.901
Don't make me laugh.

10:07.561 --> 10:12.491
But if you can do some mining 
work for me, I'll believe you.

10:12.491 --> 10:14.321
Every blacksmith should 
be able to do that.

10:15.241 --> 10:16.371
Of course!

10:25.331 --> 10:26.581
Who is this guy?

10:26.581 --> 10:29.041
All the pieces of ore 
he's finding are huge!

10:29.041 --> 10:31.551
And he's still wearing armor!

10:31.551 --> 10:34.261
<b></b>You obtained

10:31.551 --> 10:34.261
<b></b>pieces

10:31.551 --> 10:34.261
<b></b>of <b>iron ore</b>

10:35.091 --> 10:37.511
<i>My body feels like it's 
about to fall apart.</i>

10:35.471 --> 10:37.511
<b></b>You obtained

10:35.471 --> 10:37.511
<b></b>pieces

10:35.471 --> 10:37.511
<b></b>of <b>iron ore</b>

10:37.931 --> 10:39.601
<i>But my head feels clear.</i>

10:40.011 --> 10:44.101
<i>Even something as lame as 
fortitude can be my weapon.</i>

10:42.061 --> 10:44.141
<b></b>You obtained

10:42.061 --> 10:44.141
<b></b>pieces

10:42.061 --> 10:44.141
<b></b>of <b>iron ore</b>

10:44.391 --> 10:45.601
<b></b>Quest

10:44.391 --> 10:45.601
<b>Mine Iron Ore</b>

10:44.641 --> 10:45.691
<i>System guidance.</i>

10:44.691 --> 10:45.601
<b></b>Quest cleared!
You got a reward!

