13:06.791 --> 13:08.501
Wh-What is this?

13:13.251 --> 13:16.041
<i>An epic-class item has been created.</i>

13:14.791 --> 13:15.591
<b>Special Jaffa Arrow</b>

13:16.421 --> 13:19.261
<i>All stats improve by 4.</i>

13:16.421 --> 13:17.961
Huh? Epic?

13:17.961 --> 13:20.881
I've never seen an arrow like this!

13:19.261 --> 13:21.261
<i>300 experience points gained.</i>

