13:25.971 --> 13:27.721
I... I did it...

13:28.351 --> 13:30.601
<i>Well, I </i>am<i> his successor.</i>

13:31.391 --> 13:32.811
<i>If I'm this good...</i>

13:32.811 --> 13:34.771
<i>I should've made a sword or something!</i>

13:35.021 --> 13:38.481
<i>I can't believe I got the 
low-probability epic ranking!</i>

13:38.821 --> 13:40.361
Why are you making that face?

13:42.741 --> 13:44.741
You're leaving already, huh?

13:44.741 --> 13:47.161
Yes. Thank you for everything.

13:47.491 --> 13:51.081
It'd be great if you 
could come live with me.

13:51.081 --> 13:53.501
Don't be a creep.

13:54.541 --> 13:57.041
<i>Just wait, players!</i>

13:57.711 --> 14:02.131
<i>Grid is gonna sell you an arrow 
like you've never seen before!</i>

14:14.981 --> 14:17.731
Let's end this now, Regas!

14:20.191 --> 14:21.151
Toban!

14:22.151 --> 14:23.281
Vantner!

14:26.571 --> 14:27.821
We are...

14:28.741 --> 14:30.331
the might of the Tzedakah Guild!

14:33.961 --> 14:37.461
We managed to get the 
Blue Orichalcum, but...

14:37.461 --> 14:38.711
Thank you.

14:39.921 --> 14:41.421
Let me see your jaffa arrows.

14:41.421 --> 14:42.551
Sure thing.

14:42.551 --> 14:44.721
It's not going well.

14:44.721 --> 14:49.261
Yes. We'll need to enhance our equipment 
to minimize the damage we take.

14:49.261 --> 14:53.141
Yes. But for now, we'll have 
to get by with what we have...

14:53.141 --> 14:54.731
Here you are.

14:55.981 --> 14:57.101
Jishuka?

14:57.101 --> 14:57.811
Look!

14:58.521 --> 15:00.071
E-Epic?!

15:01.271 --> 15:05.781
I've asked all kinds of 
blacksmiths to make us arrows.

15:06.201 --> 15:11.701
But even the top blacksmith, 
Panmir, couldn't make an epic arrow...

15:12.161 --> 15:15.081
H-Hey, who sold you this arrow?

15:15.081 --> 15:20.131
They didn't give their name,
so I don't know.

15:21.131 --> 15:23.001
Useless NPC!

15:23.001 --> 15:23.921
Find him.

15:25.011 --> 15:27.381
Contact all guild members.

15:27.761 --> 15:30.721
Find the one who made it, no matter what!

15:36.391 --> 15:37.561
<i>I'm done.</i>

15:39.651 --> 15:42.361
Bro, are you okay?

15:42.361 --> 15:44.821
I-I'm just fine...

15:45.361 --> 15:50.201
I just worked a little too hard.

15:50.201 --> 15:51.871
Takumi...

15:51.871 --> 15:54.871
Call off from your day job tomorrow.

15:55.661 --> 15:56.581
Here.

15:59.081 --> 16:00.041
Dad...

16:00.711 --> 16:02.541
You can't work too hard.

16:02.541 --> 16:04.551
Make sure you're eating.

16:04.551 --> 16:05.921
You too, Mom?

16:06.881 --> 16:09.511
They were both waiting for you to eat.

16:09.511 --> 16:11.141
I swear...

16:11.551 --> 16:14.561
Your grandpa back in the countryside 
is worried about you too, you know.

16:15.181 --> 16:17.021
Now, let's eat dinner.

16:17.021 --> 16:18.601
Oh, curry today, huh?

16:18.641 --> 16:21.601
Oh, those are the pickled 
shallots Grandpa sent us, right?

16:21.101 --> 16:25.281
<i>I really can't thank my family enough...</i>

16:21.601 --> 16:24.941
Yes. They're delicious.

16:26.111 --> 16:29.281
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven...

16:32.821 --> 16:33.581
Dad...

16:34.491 --> 16:36.911
A day labor job usually 
pays about 9,000 yen.

16:36.911 --> 16:39.371
Oh, and can you pay off my loans?

16:45.341 --> 16:50.301
<i>I put these arrows up for 6 silver! 
I can't believe they went for 92 silver!</i>

16:45.341 --> 16:50.301
<b>Sale</b>

16:45.341 --> 16:50.301
<b>Sold</b>

16:45.341 --> 16:50.301
<b>Special Jaffa Arrows</b>

16:45.341 --> 16:50.301
<b>Pieces</b>

16:45.341 --> 16:50.301
<b>Price</b>

16:45.341 --> 16:50.301
<b>Silver</b>

16:45.341 --> 16:50.301
<b>Total Sales</b>

16:45.341 --> 16:50.301
<b>Silver</b>

16:45.341 --> 16:50.301
<b>Fees</b>

16:45.341 --> 16:50.301
<b>Silver</b>

16:45.341 --> 16:50.301
<b>Amount Received</b>

16:45.341 --> 16:50.301
<b>Silver</b>

16:50.551 --> 16:55.891
<i>100 silver is 1 gold, so in terms of 
real money, I made over 10,000 yen!</i>

16:55.891 --> 16:58.771
<i>That's way better than day labor!</i>

17:01.101 --> 17:05.321
<i>Just you wait! I'm gonna make bank!</i>

17:05.321 --> 17:08.401
Hey, old man, speed this carriage up!

17:08.401 --> 17:10.151
You're pissing me off!

17:10.151 --> 17:11.571
Just shut up and ride the carriage!

17:12.611 --> 17:14.451
What a creep!

17:20.791 --> 17:22.961
<i>So this is Winston Village?</i>

17:23.211 --> 17:25.961
<i>It's ruled by Earl Steim...</i>

17:25.961 --> 17:28.171
<i>Where've I heard that name before?</i>

17:28.461 --> 17:32.181
<i>Anyway, I'll put my heavy 
equipment in my safe...</i>

17:34.391 --> 17:35.851
We will keep this safe.

17:35.851 --> 17:39.851
<i>I can just keep my potions and
special jaffa arrows with me.</i>

17:39.851 --> 17:43.731
Okay, time to find a blacksmith 
and make some money!

17:46.231 --> 17:49.571
I bet this place has mid-ranked 
blacksmiths or better!

17:57.371 --> 17:59.661
Um...

18:05.211 --> 18:06.791
Who's there?

18:08.631 --> 18:10.841
What do you want?

18:12.881 --> 18:15.051
I'm Grid.

18:15.551 --> 18:16.761
I'm Kahn.

18:16.761 --> 18:18.891
I had a request...

18:19.471 --> 18:21.601
This is a well-made arrow.

18:21.601 --> 18:24.391
I want to make an item that 
sells for more than this.

18:24.391 --> 18:25.901
Can you help me?

18:31.191 --> 18:35.071
I had a son your age once...

18:35.951 --> 18:37.951
I'd like to help you.

18:38.581 --> 18:39.831
But I can't.

18:40.161 --> 18:42.201
The forge is closed.

18:42.201 --> 18:44.001
What?! But why?!

18:44.001 --> 18:46.291
Pressure from the Mero Company.

18:46.291 --> 18:49.791
They're buying up all the materials 
and harassing me in all sorts of ways.

18:49.791 --> 18:51.591
Mero?

18:52.131 --> 18:54.131
Hey, Old Man Kahn!

18:54.131 --> 18:54.551
What the?!

18:54.551 --> 18:58.851
Today you're gonna sign this thing and 
hand your shop and land over to us!

18:58.851 --> 19:00.511
These villains...

19:00.511 --> 19:04.561
Seven generations in the business, 
and they want to end it like this?

19:05.351 --> 19:07.901
Your idiot son is dead, right?

19:07.901 --> 19:09.521
What do you care about this place anymore?

19:10.151 --> 19:11.401
Shut up!

19:11.401 --> 19:14.611
Don't you talk about my son 
with your filthy mouth!

19:16.111 --> 19:17.491
<i>Calm down.</i>

19:17.491 --> 19:19.571
<i>Don't get involved.</i>

19:19.571 --> 19:21.741
<i>It's just an NPC, for crying out loud.</i>

19:22.951 --> 19:23.791
<i>But...</i>

19:24.291 --> 19:27.081
Your grandpa back in the countryside 
is worried about you too, you know.

19:27.331 --> 19:30.841
I had a son your age once...

19:30.841 --> 19:31.461
<i>Somehow...</i>

19:31.461 --> 19:32.841
<i>System guidance.</i>

19:31.591 --> 19:33.171
<b></b>Quest

19:31.591 --> 19:33.171
<b>The Blacksmith's Wrath</b>

19:32.211 --> 19:35.091
<i>He reminds me of my grandpa.</i>

19:32.841 --> 19:36.801
<i>The quest "The Blacksmith's Wrath"
has been created.</i>

19:37.181 --> 19:39.391
Knock it off, you punks.

19:39.391 --> 19:41.051
Say what? Punks?

19:41.051 --> 19:41.601
Young one...

19:41.601 --> 19:43.971
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

19:44.431 --> 19:48.481
If you're gonna bother Old Man Kahn, 
you'll have to deal with me!

19:48.481 --> 19:53.271
<i>Quest acceptance reward "Legendary 
Blacksmith's Wrath" has been activated.</i>

19:48.601 --> 19:50.481
<b>Skills</b>

19:48.941 --> 19:50.481
<b>Legendary Blacksmith's Wrath</b>

19:51.941 --> 19:54.321
You want to mess with us? I'll kill you!

19:53.271 --> 19:56.191
<i>For the next twenty seconds,
your attack power and attack speed</i>

19:56.191 --> 19:57.741
<i>will be greatly enhanced.</i>

19:59.781 --> 20:01.161
What is that arrow?

20:01.161 --> 20:03.661
Oh, you can tell how 
awesome this arrow is?

20:01.491 --> 20:03.331
I'll get revenge for Neil!

20:03.661 --> 20:05.411
You've got good taste!

20:05.951 --> 20:08.161
Damn it! Rush him, boys!

20:11.501 --> 20:12.841
Fool!

20:13.961 --> 20:16.011
Damn it! These are expensive!

20:21.301 --> 20:22.721
<i>Is this it?</i>

20:25.431 --> 20:26.601
<i>What's that?</i>

20:26.601 --> 20:28.391
Die!

20:32.481 --> 20:34.441
You threw away your weapon, idiot!

20:34.691 --> 20:38.281
Old man! You want to 
protect this forge, right?!

20:38.281 --> 20:39.401
Of course I do!

20:39.651 --> 20:41.611
If you'll help me,

20:41.911 --> 20:44.741
I'll protect this place 
no matter what happens!

20:44.741 --> 20:48.501
Then I'll be taking the 
power of this item!

20:49.121 --> 20:51.211
There's nowhere left to run!

20:51.211 --> 20:52.581
Give it up!

20:52.581 --> 20:54.541
You're just a wimp who 
relies on his items!

21:00.091 --> 21:01.011
Yes.

21:01.301 --> 21:03.641
Even if people mock me...

21:04.141 --> 21:06.891
This is the only way I can get stronger.

21:09.101 --> 21:10.311
Overgeared.

21:15.821 --> 21:17.731
Who is this guy?

21:19.151 --> 21:22.111
<b></b>Quest

21:19.151 --> 21:22.111
<b>The Blacksmith's Wrath</b>

21:19.571 --> 21:22.111
<b></b>Quest cleared!
You got a reward!

21:19.571 --> 21:20.741
<i>Quest cleared.</i>

