21:20.741 --> 21:23.871
<i>15,200 EXP earned.</i>

21:23.871 --> 21:25.831
<i>You are now level 21.</i>

21:25.831 --> 21:26.741
Old Man Kahn,

21:26.871 --> 21:28.701
<b>Valhalla</b>

21:26.871 --> 21:30.461
<b>Dainsleif (Replica)</b>

21:27.291 --> 21:29.791
why do you have strong items like these?

21:30.661 --> 21:33.711
Don't tell me you understand 
what they're worth...

21:33.711 --> 21:36.711
Yeah, I can tell just by looking at them.

21:36.711 --> 21:38.171
As well as who made them.

21:41.051 --> 21:41.721
Old man?

21:41.721 --> 21:43.801
Hey, don't just lie there!

21:43.801 --> 21:46.221
Teach me how to be a blacksmith!

21:46.221 --> 21:50.021
Old man!

21:51.601 --> 21:54.271
So those mercenaries went missing?

21:54.271 --> 21:58.861
They were seen heading to 
the blacksmith's, but...

21:58.861 --> 22:01.861
I guess they were just 
useless thugs in the end.

22:04.111 --> 22:05.451
Rabbit...

22:06.411 --> 22:09.201
I'll let you handle this.
